{"format":1,"key":"zone:razorfenkraul","path":"/lore/zone/razorfenkraul","name":"Razorfen Kraul","kind":"dungeon","label":"Dungeon","zone":{"key":"razorfenkraul","name":"Razorfen Kraul","path":"/lore/zone/razorfenkraul"},"levels":"Levels 29-38","description":"In the far south of the Barrens, quilboar tribes defend the sacred brambles of Razorfen Kraul. They revere the thickets as the resting place of their…","intro":[],"clips":[{"id":"zone:razorfenkraul","part":"narration","anchor":"story","title":"The story","paras":["In the far south of the Barrens, quilboar tribes defend the sacred brambles of Razorfen Kraul. They revere the thickets as the resting place of their ancestor, Agamaggan, while Charlga Razorflank’s rule threatens the region.","Ten thousand years ago, during the War of the Ancients, Agamaggan joined the fight against the Burning Legion. The colossal wild god was slain, but his sacrifice preserved life on Azeroth. Legends say massive thorn-covered vines sprang up wherever his blood seeped into the earth, forming thick, defensive labyrinths across the southern plains. The quilboar revere Agamaggan as their divine ancestor and claimed these thickets as holy lands. The greatest became the Razorfen."],"hash":"c3b1aa","voices":{"male-narrator":{"sha":"ea900eac46","sec":43},"female-narrator":{"sha":"344e13ee2e","sec":42}}}],"sources":[{"kind":"wiki","title":"Razorfen Kraul (Classic)","url":"https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/Razorfen_Kraul_(Classic)"},{"kind":"wiki","title":"Razorfen Kraul","url":"https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/Razorfen_Kraul"}],"related":[{"p":"/lore/topic/agamaggan","n":"Agamaggan","k":"topic"},{"p":"/lore/topic/quilboar","n":"Quilboar","k":"topic"},{"p":"/lore/topic/razorfen","n":"Razorfen","k":"topic"},{"p":"/lore/npc/charlga-razorflank","n":"Charlga Razorflank","k":"boss"},{"p":"/lore/npc/overlord-ramtusk","n":"Overlord Ramtusk","k":"boss"},{"p":"/lore/quest/1101-the-crone-of-the-kraul","n":"The Crone of the Kraul","k":"quest"},{"p":"/lore/sub